WEBVTT

1
00:01.200 --> 00:03.150 line:12%
Südlohn in the Münsterland region.

2
00:03.380 --> 00:07.160 line:12%
This is the base of a team that makes facades clean again,

3
00:07.180 --> 00:08.750 line:12%
without repainting them.

4
00:09.640 --> 00:11.590 line:12%
The company is called FassadenTrio.

5
00:12.000 --> 00:15.630 line:12%
Today's job: a multi-storey building.

6
00:15.960 --> 00:20.090 line:12%
Instead of scaffolding, there is only an aerial work platform in front of the house.

7
00:20.580 --> 00:25.290 line:12%
Grey and green facades are mostly caused by algae and fungi,

8
00:25.360 --> 00:28.360 line:12%
in around nine out of ten cases, according to the company.

9
00:28.380 --> 00:31.210 line:12%
Its answer is a three-step process.

10
00:31.620 --> 00:36.010 line:12%
First, the technicians apply a specially developed cleaning agent.

11
00:36.360 --> 00:38.930 line:12%
Then they rinse off the loosened growth,

12
00:39.080 --> 00:41.930 line:12%
using low water pressure so that the render stays intact.

13
00:42.300 --> 00:45.490 line:12%
Finally, a transparent protective coat is applied to the facade.

14
00:45.740 --> 00:50.290 line:12%
It is meant to delay regrowth for up to five years, the company says.

15
00:50.740 --> 00:51.650 line:12%
And the cost?

16
00:51.980 --> 00:56.850 line:12%
Up to seventy per cent less than a new coat of paint, says FassadenTrio.

17
00:57.180 --> 00:59.990 line:12%
Anyone who is unsure can try it first:

18
01:00.100 --> 01:03.330 line:12%
with a free test patch on their own building.
